cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Project KAGURA: quantitative research on the Japanese yen and Japanese monetary policy"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Blasco
    given-names: Aki
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Reproducible research code and documentation studying whether USD/JPY has structurally
  decoupled from the US-Japan interest-rate differential. Version 0.1 contains the data
  foundation and exploratory diagnostics; no formal hypothesis test has been run yet.
keywords:
  - Japanese yen
  - USD/JPY
  - interest-rate differential
  - structural breaks
  - monetary policy
